              <li>
                <p>
                  Vertical asymptotes at <m>x=-3,3</m>, Horizontal asymptote at <m>y=1</m>
                </p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <p>
                  Vertical asymptote at <m>x=3</m>, Horizontal asymptote at <m>y=1</m>
                </p>
